s['sourceNote']='Printed page 168. Summary only (the essay\'s modern text; copyright uncertain): the four printed paragraphs on this page are paraphrased in the three languages; the fourth continues on the next page. The printed text contains irregular wording (e.g. "intramural social and extracurricular activities") and stray marks around "drug abuse"; not reproduced. A phone-number strip, the watermark and a few pencil marks are excluded. Border lines, pink corner flags are excluded. The page number 168 is printed in a diamond at the foot.'
